#Real Life Applications
##High-order thinking skills (HOTS) plays an essential role in computer science and data engineering as this field requires people to be able to 
apply high-level thinking skills in solving problems, make decisions, innovate and strive to compete globally. Within the realm of computational thinking, 
critical thinking can truly assist people in designing efficient algorithms, debugging code as well as identifying creative and alternative solutions to
solve complex problems. Furthermore, in the computer science field, it is essential to encourage creative thinking by combining programming and visual art 
skills in introductory computer science projects. 
